      110.16,
      376.15,
      295.4,
      386.24
    ],
    "text": "My Reference No. : POL/HGD/LND/13/56/005.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      116.88,
      387.19,
      295.37,
      397.28
    ],
    "text": "Land Ministry's Ref. No.: 4-3/9/216/PRD/453.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.44,
      414.08,
      295.72,
      490.16
    ],
    "text": "HAVING been duly directed by the Hon. Minister of Landsand Parliamentary Reforms under the SubSection One of theSection Two of the Land Acquisition Act, as amended by theLand Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, I herebygive notice to you as required by the SubSection Two of thesaid Section that the land morefully describe below is requiredfor a public purpose :",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.44,
      513.19,
      295.44,
      534.08
    ],
    "text": "Public purpose means : To acquire portions of land to providea filling station to the Minneriya area.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.44,
      546.07,
      295.09,
      633.2
    ],
    "text": "Description of the area above referred to :- The allotmentof land called Patapilikanda Kele to contain 00736 Hect.,depicted as Lot Alphabet A in the Advanced Tracing No.PO/ HKD/2019/127 dated 21/8/2019 prepared by the SurveyorGeneral, located in the village of Minneriya in the SinhalaPattuwa Minor Division in the Hingurakgoda DivisionalSecretary's Division in the District of Polonnaruwa in the NorthCentral Province.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      56.64,
      741.88,
      138.41,
      749.8
    ],
    "text": "G31632 - 17 (2019/12)",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.91920804977417
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      307.68,
      332.04,
      360.28,
      342.12
    ],
    "text": "Boundaries :",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      307.68,
      354.08,
      547.71,
      386.24
    ],
    "text": "On the North by: Lot No. 4 and 7; On the East by: Lot No. 7;On the South by: Lot 7 and 194; On the West by: Lot No.194,161 and 4.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      307.68,
      395.84,
      547.93,
      443.12
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land are required toappear personally or by agents duly authorized in writingbefore me at the Hingurakgoda Divisional Secretariat on 30thNovember 2019.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      307.68,
      453.44,
      547.67,
      513.67
    ],
    "text": "It should by notified to me in document in duplicate thenature of their interest in the land, the particulars of theirclaims for computation for the land, the amount ofcompensation and the details of the computation of suchamount, on or before 20th November, 2019.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
